  "ssml": "<speak version=\"1.0\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis\" xmlns:mstts=\"https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts\" xml:lang=\"en-PH\">\n  <voice name=\"en-PH-RosaNeural\">\n    <mstts:express-as style=\"friendly\">\n      <prosody rate=\"96%\" pitch=\"+2%\">\n        Ready to build the bridge across <phoneme alphabet=\"ipa\" ph=\"puːˈhɑːdɑː\">Pujada</phoneme> Bay? <break time=\"650ms\"/> Here&apos;s a fun way to spot <emphasis level=\"moderate\">Cause and Effect</emphasis>! <break time=\"550ms\"/> Picture a row of <emphasis level=\"moderate\">dominoes</emphasis>. <break time=\"550ms\"/> Cold mountain air on Mount <phoneme alphabet=\"ipa\" ph=\"hɑːmiˈɡiːtɑːn\">Hamiguitan</phoneme> makes you shiver, <break time=\"300ms\"/> right? <break time=\"650ms\"/> <break time=\"800ms\"/> Just like a bright sunny afternoon at <phoneme alphabet=\"ipa\" ph=\"dɑːˈhiːkɑːn\">Dahican</phoneme> Beach makes you sweat! <break time=\"550ms\"/> One action triggers the next.\n      </prosody>\n    </mstts:express-as>\n  </voice>\n</speak>",
